 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can you suggest a book for a twelve year old who says reading is boring?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try a fast, funny adventure with short chapters, or a graphic novel. They feel quick and rewarding.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Graphic novels count as reading?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.47,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Absolutely. They build vocabulary and following a story, and they're often a gateway to longer books.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, that's not right.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_07",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'm fairly sure about it, but I could be wrong. What sounds off to you?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "He loves football. Is there anything",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.63,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "you know, sporty?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.81,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "There are lots of middle grade novels about kids on football teams. Ask a librarian, they'll know the popular ones.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.96,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good idea, we go to the library on Saturdays anyway.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg1"
  },
